/* Independent literal contract, NOT an assembler input or decoder.
 * P(name, architectural destination, exact REX.W D1 /5 mod3 bytes).
 * R/X are ignored here; B selects the ordinary low/high GPR bank.
 * RSP, capture pointer R14 and scratch R10 are never destinations. */
